; Voskresenskaya Station -- prologue floor plan.
;
; A pylon station: two platform halls, a row of pylons down each
; side pierced by archways, and one central hall between them. West
; is the ticket hall and the street shutter. East is the rose window.
;
;   #  wall          M  marble concourse   p  platform
;   !  tactile edge strip                  T  running road
;   C  the stopped 04:41                   O  pylon
;   t  turnstile     X  gap in the turnstile line (shut)
;   G  stained glass H  street shutter     E  escalator
;   K  kiosk         V  vending machine    b  bench
;   s  service door  ,  maintenance corridor
;   *  ceiling light @  player spawn
;
